      description:
        '(1) Ensure not to carry out any repairs or modifications to any vessel unless the prior approval of repairs or modifications, procedure and their method of execution is obtained from the Chief Controller or Controller authorised by him on payment of a scrutiny fee of rupees 2500/-.\n\n(2) Ensure to carry out the repairs and modifications in the manner and by practices acceptable under the design code including Non Destructive Testing (NDT) methods and pressure testing under stage wise inspection of inspector recognised by the Chief Controller.\n\n(3) Ensure that before any repairs, additions or alterations are carried out to any vessel, the same shall be completely emptied and purged with an inert gas.\n\n(4) Maintain complete record of repairs, additions or alterations and make it available to the Chief Controller or Controller authorized by him and obtain his permission before re-commissioning of the vessel.',
