      description:
        'Ensure that:\n(I) No adult worker shall be required or allowed to work in a factory for more than forty-eight hours in any week.\n(ii) No adult worker shall be required or allowed to work in a factory for more than nine hours in any day\n(iii) The periods of work of adult workers in a factory each day shall be so fixed that no period shall exceed five hours and that no worker shall work for more than five hours before he has had an interval for rest of at least half an hour.\n(iv) The periods of work of an adult worker in a factory shall be so arranged that inclusive of his intervals for rest, they shall not spread over more than ten and a half hours in any day\n(v) Work shall not be carried on in any factory by me and of a system of shifts so arranged that more than one relay of workers is engaged in work of the same kind at the same time\n(vi) No adult worker shall be required or allowed to work in any factory on any day on which he has already been working in any other factory\n(vii) No adult worker shall be required or allowed to work in any factory otherwise than in accordance with the notice of periods of work for adults displayed in the factory and the entries made beforehand against his name in the register of adult workers of the factory.',
